msgid ""
"Participatory Budgeting (PB) is a democratic process where community "
"members\n"
"    directly decide how to spend part of a public budget. The goal of "
"Participatory\n"
"    Budgeting in Boston is to empower residents to elevate community "
"centered\n"
"    project ideas with an emphasis on social and racial equity."
msgstr ""
"Miisaaniyad ka qaybqaadashada (PB) waa hab dimuqraadi ah oo ay xubnaha "
"bulshada\n"
" si toos ah u go&#39;aansada sida loo isticmaalo qayb ka mid ah miisaaniyada "
"dadweynaha. Hadafka ka qaybqaadashada\n"
" Miisaaniyadda Boston waa in la xoojiyo dadka deegaanka si ay kor ugu "
"qaadaan bulshada udub dhexaad u ah\n"
" fikradaha mashruuca iyadoo xoogga la saarayo sinnaanta bulshada iyo "
"jinsiyadda."

#: src/flavors/cycle1/templates/prelaunch.html:117
#: src/flavors/cycle2/templates/prelaunch.html:117
#: src/flavors/cycle3/templates/prelaunch.html:114
msgid ""
"By engaging in Participatory Budgeting, Bostonians of all ages and\n"
"    backgrounds can help inform priorities and future investments for the\n"
"    City’s larger budget process. "
msgstr ""
"Marka aad ka qaybqaadato miisaaniyada ka qaybqaadashada, reer Boston ee "
"da&#39;kasta leh iyo\n"
" Taariikhdu waxay kaa caawin kartaa inaad wargeliso mudnaanta iyo "
"maalgashiga mustaqbalka ee\n"
" Habka miisaaniyadeed ee weyn ee magaalada. "

#: src/flavors/cycle1/templates/prelaunch.html:121
#: src/flavors/cycle2/templates/prelaunch.html:121
#: src/flavors/cycle3/templates/prelaunch.html:118
#, python-format
msgid "Come back on %(return_date)s to submit your project ideas!"
msgstr ""
"Ku soo noqo %(return_date)s si aad u soo gudbiso fikradahaaga mashruuca!"

