"Fasalada akhris-qoraalka dhijitaalka ah ee muwaadiniinta waayeelka ah si ay "
"u bartaan xirfado cusub oo ay kor ugu qaadaan xidhiidhada bulshada;"

#: src/flavors/cycle3/jstemplates/pages/overview.html:7
msgid ""
"Enhance public spaces through infrastructure projects (public art, street "
