"departments/participatory-budgeting/ideas-action-project-implementation</a>"

#: src/flavors/cycle3/jstemplates/pages/overview.html:12
msgid ""
"From August through September 2026, the City will review all the submitted "
"project ideas. Then, in the fall, the Office of Participatory Budgeting will "
"host public workshops for residents to review, prioritize, and develop these "
"ideas into project proposals for the PB ballot. Voting will take place in "
"January of 2027!"
msgstr ""
"Laga bilaabo Agoosto ilaa Sebtembar 2026, Magaaladu waxay dib u eegi doontaa "
"dhammaan fikradaha mashruuca ee la soo gudbiyay. Kadib, dayrta, Xafiiska "
"Miisaaniyadda Ka-qaybgalka wuxuu martigelin doonaa aqoon-is-weydaarsiyo "
"dadweyne si dadka deegaanka ay dib ugu eegaan, u kala hormariyaan, una "
"horumariyaan fikradahan soo-jeedimaha mashruuca ee codbixinta PB. Codbixintu "
"waxay dhici doontaa Janaayo 2027!"

