"delayed or undelivered messages."
msgstr ""

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:2
msgid ""
"<strong>Help instructions:</strong> If you need help, you can email us at "
"pb@boston.gov. <a href=\"mailto:pb@boston.gov\">Send us an email.</a>"
msgstr ""

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:3
msgid ""
"<strong>Message frequency:</strong> You will get one text message with a "
"verification code each time you request one. We won't send you any more text "
"messages unless you ask for a new code."
msgstr ""

#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/terms.html:4
